"title":"Boy asking newspaper reading man to play","illustrator":"Madhuri Purandare","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":7,"title":"A moustached man playing with a boy and reading book to him","illustrator":"Madhuri Purandare","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":8,"title":"A boy talking to old lady peeling vegetables","illustrator":"Madhuri Purandare","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":9,"title":"An old lady with boy on her lap","illustrator":"Madhuri Purandare","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":10,"title":"Boy asking his mother to walk with him","illustrator":"Madhuri Purandare","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":11,"title":"Boy and mother looking at the sky and moon","illustrator":"Madhuri Purandare","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":12,"title":"A boy and mother sitting under the night sky with tree background","illustrator":"Madhuri Purandare","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-25"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/460712-yaake-antha-gotthilla/p01.jpg","width":708,"height":783},"text":["ಅಪ್ಪು ಹೇಳ್ತಾನೆ, “ತುಂಬಾ ಚೆನ್ನಾಗಿ ಅನಿಸ್ತಿದೆ.”","“ಯಾಕೆ?”","“ಗೊತ್ತಿಲ್ಲ.”"]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/460712-yaake-antha-gotthilla/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":784},"text":["“ಸುಮ್ಮನಿರು! ಮಗು ಏಳುತ್ತೆ.”"]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/460712-yaake-antha-gotthilla/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":783},"text":["“ಕೋಪ ಬರಲು ಏನಾಯಿತು?”","“ಗೊತ್ತಿಲ್ಲ.”"]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/460712-yaake-antha-gotthilla/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":783},"text":["“ತುಂಬಾ ಹಸಿವಾದಾಗ ಕೋಪ ಬರುತ್ತೆ, ಹೌದಲ್ವ?”"]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/460712-yaake-antha-gotthilla/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":783},"text":["ಅಪ್ಪು ಗೊಣಗುತ್ತ, “ಬೇಜಾರಾಗಿದೆ.”"]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/460712-yaake-antha-gotthilla/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":784},"text":["ಅಪ್ಪ ಎಂದರು, “ಬಾ, ಆಡೋಣ.”"]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/460712-yaake-antha-gotthilla/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":784},"text":["“ಅಜ್ಜಿ, ನನಗೆ ಭಯ ಆಗ್ತಿದೆ.”","“ಯಾವುದರ ಬಗ್ಗೆ ಭಯ ಮಗು?”","“ಗೊತ್ತಿಲ್ಲ.”"]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/460712-yaake-antha-gotthilla/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":784},"text":["“ಈಗ ಆರಾಮ ಅನಿಸ್ತಿದೆಯ?”","ಅಷ್ಟರಲ್ಲಿ ಅಮ್ಮ ಕರೆದಳು."]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/460712-yaake-antha-gotthilla/p09.jpg","width":708,"height":784},"text":["“ಅಪ್ಪು, ಏನೋ ತೋರಿಸುವೆ ಬಾ.”"]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/460712-yaake-antha-gotthilla/p10.jpg","width":708,"height":784},"text":["“ರಾತ್ರಿ ಎಷ್ಟು ಚೆನ್ನಾಗಿದೆ.”"]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/460712-yaake-antha-gotthilla/p11.jpg","width":708,"height":783},"text":["“ನಿನ್ನ ಭಯ ಹೋಯ್ತು ಅನಿಸತ್ತೆ. ಮಿಂಚುಹುಳುಗಳು","ನಿನ್ನ ಭಯ ತೆಗೆದುಕೊಂಡು ಹೋದವಾ?”","ಅಪ್ಪು, “ಗೊತ್ತಿಲ್ಲ…”"]}],"wordCount":59}